Hi Lauren,

I am opening this thread so that everything on the Castaneda, Adams and Davis=
 investor relations program stays in one place and easy to find, and I have c=
opied my colleagues so that we are all working from the same messages as the =
engagement gets underway. On our side, Laura Bradley will handle much of the =
drafting and keep the schedule straight, and Michelle Black will run the appr=
oval timelines so that nothing you need to see reaches you late or out of ord=
er. For the file, our point of contact with your office is you, Lauren Heath,=
 and yours with us is me.

We have made a start on the message work, and I expect a first cut of the cor=
e narrative to you within the next couple of weeks. Before that draft hardens=
, one read from you would help us more than anything else at this stage: whic=
h audience we should lead with, since the investor story and the wider market=
 story do not always want the same opening.

If it is easier to talk that through than to write it out, send me two or thr=
ee windows and I will set a short call; otherwise a line back is plenty and w=
e will build from there.

Sincerely


--=20
Michael Morris
Partner
+1 (415) 555-0195

